%% tip: Bram host :: The Rust process. Most files below are written only by it; the agent writes worklist.json and drafts.
%% tip: Worklist files :: resources/worklist.json (metadata) and resources/worklist-drafts/<id>.md (before/after prose). Gitignored in this repo.
%% tip: Authorization record :: resources/.worklist-authorization.json. One slot, 30 minute TTL, gitignored.
%% tip: Execution claim :: resources/.inflight-claim.json. Single slot; cleared at turn end and on startup if stale.
%% tip: Claim refs :: refs/bram/claims/* point at trees; ordered ledger in resources/.claim-intervals.json.
%% tip: Worklist history :: resources/worklist-history/<unix_ms>.json and .md snapshots. Host-written.
%% tip: Audit ledger :: resources/audit-ledger.jsonl. Metadata only, best-effort, not tamper-evident.
%% tip: State mirror :: SQLite shadow of the authorization and claim files. Files stay the truth in phase A.
%% tip: Search index :: SQLite FTS5 outside the repo, one database per project, behind GET /__search.
%% tip: Trace log :: resources/bram-traces/bram-trace.log, archived each run. On by default.
%% tip: Provider transcripts :: Claude JSONL and Codex rollouts live under the user's home, not the repo.
%% tip: bram-guard :: Reads resources/.worklist-authorization.json directly and uses its existence as the project-root marker.
%% tip: Agent pane :: The XMLUI app. Page-local state is lost on tab switch; session state is held above the pages.
%% tip: Pane browser storage :: localStorage for decisions, sessionStorage for focus; project-scoped keys carry a project suffix.
%% tip: Git remote :: A normal push transfers branches, not refs/bram/*.
%% tip: snapshot on change :: A filesystem watcher calls maybe_snapshot_worklist.
%% tip: records approval :: Written through the record_worklist_action_authorization Tauri command.
%% tip: writes claim :: write_inflight_claim_sentinel, called in the same command as the approval.
%% tip: captures boundary trees :: capture_claim_tree uses a temporary index so the real index is untouched.
%% tip: appends decisions :: Authorization decisions and gated commits, ungated by the trace toggle.
%% tip: mirrors writes :: mirror_* calls run after each successful file write; errors are trace-only.
%% tip: appends trace lines :: append_bram_trace_line, one line per waypoint.
%% tip: indexed into FTS5 :: A background indexer covers sessions, commits, issues and worklist history.
%% tip: read by host :: The host watches and projects transcripts for turn state and the Transcript tab.
%% tip: read by guard :: Per-call, from a separate process.
%% tip: saves decisions and focus :: Decisions persist; focus dies with the session.
%% tip: shared only by explicit refspec :: Dashed: claim refs are machine-local unless someone pushes them on purpose.
